    "long_instructions": "## Build Your App Framework\r\n### What to do:\r\nStart building the foundation of your web app. Create your HTML and CSS structure and connect your JavaScript file. Your goal in this level is to make your app come alive with its first interactive feature.\r\n\r\n**Focus On:**\r\n- Setting up your main layout and linking files.\r\n- Coding your first user interaction (like a button or input).\r\n- Making something on the page change in response.\r\n- Save versions as you see necessary with at least saving a **Version 1**\r\n\r\n**Ask AI for help if you get stuck.** Possible stems:\r\n- How can I link my JavaScript file so it runs when I click a button?\r\n- Why isn’t my event listener working?\r\n- What’s one way I could make my first interaction more interesting?\r\n\r\n**Your goal:**\r\nA working scaffold with at least one successful interaction between user input and page response.",
